    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting drawback, one Chance feat, one Deck feat</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Any deck feats you possess count as chance feats for the purpose of determining your pool of kismet. Any chance feats you possess count as deck feats for the purpose of how many deck feats you possess, although such chance feats do not grant additional deck manipulations.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
